# MDM Engine

This is a Databricks / Spark-native Customer MDM Match & Merge project.

Before making substantial changes, read **AGENTS.md** at the repo root for pipeline overview, table roles, conventions (no UDFs, no GraphFrames, country-partitioned Delta), and what is intentionally out of scope.

Base implementation language is **Python PySpark** under `src/matching/`. Do not replace it with the Scala prototype notebook.
